              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Scotdog"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Yum! I've never had rice pudding so I wasn't sure what I was in for. My husband has diabetes so I used a bit less than 1/2 cup of Splenda and 1 T packed brown sugar in place of the sugar. Still not really good for a diabetic, but he can have a few bites. I only had regular raisins and they were pretty packed together so I added them in early. This gave them a bit of time to plump up. I make a homemade version of pumpkin pie spice so I used that in place of the cinnamon &amp; used more because I love it :) Thanks for sharing!",
            "datePublished": "2013-02-28T08:24:43.167Z"
          },
          {
