              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ElfinBao1107"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It easy to make and absolutely delicious! I used 1/4 cup of coconut sugar and just under 1/3 cup of sultanas because I don't like it too sweet and it turned out perfect for my taste buds. Will definitely make again!",
