              "name": "basg101"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We're trying to get healthier, and I nearly only use brown rice. I had never tried rice pudding with brown rice, so I gave this a whirl. It wasn't bad, but it was nothing like the incredible white rice pudding we're used to (Creamiest Rice Pudding on this site). We'll be going back to that for rice pudding and saving the brown rice for suppers. If you do make this, cut the sugar to 1/3 cup; no more is needed.",
