              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AmberLinnea"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Tried this recipe because I wanted to find an alternative to using Jasmine rice. Especially since I am having to use Brown Rice as the alternative.\n\nI cooked it following the directions and I became concerned when the consistency was not like my grandmother's recipe that has been passed down to me.\n\nThe end result was very watery, soupy and not the same or similar consistency that was expected. I ended up adding more egg and sugar to compensate and it was close but not the same.",
