            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "harmoneeeeeee"
            },
            "reviewBody": "As written, I would give this a 2 (reduce the sugar &amp; it might get bumped up). It is EXTREMELY sweet, TOO sweet. Coming from me (who has a candy stash @ ALL times), this says alot! I love sweet stuff, cake, cookies, chocolate, Airheads, you name it. I love the stuff, but this is comparable to swallowing a spoonful of sugar :P It got the extra star from the vanilla &amp; brown rice together, otherwise I would've given it a 1. I was really craving rice pudding, but this did NOT do it for me. :\\",
            "datePublished": "2012-06-13T16:18:26.537Z"
